sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Tab A
  participant S as Handler and store
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant H as Hub
  participant U as Tab B
  T->>S: PATCH /api/v1/issues/12
  S->>DB: inTx: update, audit row, commit
  S->>H: publish(audience, "issue", {id, projectId})
  H-->>U: event: issue
  U->>S: GET /api/v1/issues/12 (access-checked)
  S-->>U: the issue as B may see it
